OL,3,GNEWSAEndurance running makes you become
OL,4,Alike an animal, it is so raw
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was awful and it was hard - but it
OL,7,Fwasn't like I didn't want to be there."
OL,9,FLucy Gossage is an oncologist and
OL,10,Fformer professional triathlete who has
OL,11,Fnow carved out a niche in endurance
OL,12,Frunning.
OL,14,FBut after winning one of the world's
OL,15,Ftoughest endurance races in 2025 and
OL,16,Fsetting a new record for running the
OL,17,FPennine Way earlier this month, she is
OL,18,Freflecting on what keeps her going.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
