OL,3,GNEWSAEndurance running makes you become
OL,4,Alike an animal, it is so raw
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are bits when you are 'oh I'm
OL,7,Fdone with this' and then there are bits
OL,8,Fwhen you don't want it to end," she
OL,9,Fsaid.
